Package: com.wmhakuifan.smartclicker
Name: SmartClicker
Version: 1.8.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Auto clicker with image detection, ported from Smart AutoClicker for Android. Floating controls over any app: taps, swipes, pauses, and "tap when this image appears" scenarios. Open the SmartClicker app to start.
Maintainer: WMHakuifan
Author: WMHakuifan
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000) | ellekit, uikittools
